1
00:00:00,321 --> 00:00:04,451
(Penny:)...it got very real very fast
and I panicked.

2
00:00:04,659 --> 00:00:07,789
(Leonard:)Why? What are you afraid of?

3
00:00:07,954 --> 00:00:12,044
(Penny:)Well, what if we do go out and I do
something stupid and dump you again?

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,290
(Leonard:)What if I dump you?

5
00:00:18,339 --> 00:00:20,339
(Penny:)Come on, be serious.

6
00:00:21,176 --> 00:00:24,806
(Leonard:)Well, how about if we don't think
about this as a relationship?

7
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:27,470
(Leonard:)It could be more like
a new version of software.

8
00:00:27,682 --> 00:00:29,352
(Leonard:)Penny and Leonard 2.0.

9
00:00:30,101 --> 00:00:32,441
(Leonard:)We can test it internally,
shake out the bugs...

10
00:00:32,604 --> 00:00:36,394
(Leonard:)...and if we both feel it's solid,
then we'll roll it out to the public.

11
00:00:37,776 --> 00:00:39,736
(Penny:)We don't tell people
we're back together?

12
00:00:39,903 --> 00:00:42,443
(Leonard:)Exactly.
We pretend like our date went badly.

13
00:00:42,614 --> 00:00:44,494
(Penny:)Well, we don't really have to pretend.

14
00:00:45,116 --> 00:00:47,956
(Leonard:)And we let them think that we decided
to just be friends...

15
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:49,909
(Leonard:)...and that everything's cool.

16
00:00:50,079 --> 00:00:51,369
(Penny:)Okay. Great.

17
00:00:52,624 --> 00:00:59,024
(Penny:)Hey, I just remembered.
I still got one of your inhalers.

